README

This is a level above Corelib2.
we have in this folder, 

	gmp-6.1.2	-- latest gmp
	gmp 		-- link to gmp-6.1.2
	mpfr-3.1.5	-- latest mpfr
	mpfr		-- link to mpfr-3.1.5

	gmp-old		-- older version of gmp
	mpfr-old	-- older version of mpfr
	branches	-- branches of corelib2
	trunk		-- corelib2
	mpsolve

1. How to install gmp:
	-- download tar file from gmplib.org
		Then do ./configure, make, make install.
	-- put a link from $COREPATH/gmp to this gmp.
2. How to install mpfr:
	-- download tar file from mpfr.org
		Then do ./configure, make
	-- put a link from $COREPATH/mpfr to this mpfr.


